Description: Builds the pinned in-tree 'GLIMPSE2' chromosome chunking,
    reference splitting, phasing and imputation, and ligation programs against
    the 'htslib' supplied by 'Rduckhts'. Stateless R functions invoke one
    packaged executable with explicit argument vectors and return typed results
    or typed operational errors. Pinned GRCh37 and GRCh38 genetic maps are
    installed for explicit offline lookup. The phasing executable is selected explicitly
    from portable and runtime-supported AVX2, AVX-512, or NEON builds without
    searching 'PATH'.
